From: hpages at fhcrc.org (=?ISO-8859-1?Q?Herv=E9_Pag=E8s?=)
Date: Tue, 02 Mar 2010 17:00:17 -0800
Subject: [BioC] A question about org.Hs.egMAPCOUNTS
