file and then using James MacDonalds  makecdfenv package.  You can also
find information about that here:

http://www.bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/html/makecdfenv.html

And since you mentioned that you are a student, I recommend that you
used biocLite() to ensure the versions of the packages you get match
with your version of R.  You can learn more about that here:

http://www.bioconductor.org/docs/install/

Hope this helps,


  Marc



